{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "Mila! No! ...You're insane!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "Ha-ha! WHAT'S THIS?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "Is that a new expression I see?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "Go on, give me more!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "I've had enough of just watching you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "// Mita arena \"Hello\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "How's it going, my restless little wanderer?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "Still running around? Haven't had enough yet?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "What have you done to Mila?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "So you haven't, then!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "Perfect! Let's play another game!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "You..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "Let's kick things off with a little examination!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "We're going to check your coordination skills!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "And we'll test your behavior!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "What if there's something wrong with YOU!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "What if you don't even deserve that SKIN"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "that you're so proud to wear!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Show knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "Take a look..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "Which one catches your eye?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "The right one?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "Or, maybe..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "The left one?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Throw knifes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "Are you serious?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "How are they different?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "I was just messing with you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "Playing with knives is old-fashioned, anyway."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "Forget about it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "I've got something much better planned,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "like..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "// Show recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "Check this out!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "We need some music!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "What do you think of this tune?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "It gets me excited!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "I'll start"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "with the rules!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Show rules"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "While the music is playing,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "you're allowed to move."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "But when the music stops,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "don't move!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "Or you're dead!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "The goal is simple: make it to the end."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "If you can get there"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "we'll continue!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "Why are you just standing around?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "Run, sweetie, run!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "// Ready recorder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "Oh!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "Look at you! So obedient!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "A perfect little specimen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "I want you all for myself!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "That was way too easy, though, wasn't it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "Let me out!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "Don't get too comfortable!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "We've got plenty more games to play!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "Up next!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "I'm going to close my eyes..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "And when I open them,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "I better not see you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "Got it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "If I spot you, you'll be punished!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "Now then, let's begin!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "This is pointless..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Ready hide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "You made it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "You're doing great—this is getting exciting!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "But now it's going to get harder."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "Much, MUCH harder."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "Scurry! Hide! Run in circles!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "Gah, damn you to hell!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Player falls"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "That was a close one..."}
